Key symbols font for the browser build
======================================

assets/fonts/ReShikiKeys.ttf is a subset of DejaVu Sans 2.37
(DejaVuSans.ttf, SHA-256
8bd787bf3048548345b304d61421c6c0de92b0f0108906845b0ac3f7ba6a3bf3;
https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/) holding only the space and the macOS key
symbols ⌘ ⇧ ⌥ ⌃ ⌫ ↩, made with fontTools' subsetter without hinting. As the
license requires for a modified font, it is renamed ReShiki Keys; its
copyright and license name records are kept.

